D2 (gromosXX 247c95c4): EDS multi_s and pair_s force weights and lambda derivative.
md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc:518/:620 seed the per-state log-prefactors with 0.0 (an extra e^0) instead of -inf;
:550-551/:647-648 first-pair update lacks "- max" (gives a + ln 2 for a >= 0); :557 multi_s loop starts at state_i = 1, so pairs
(0, j>=2) never enter V_R or the weights; :603-604/:704-705 add pi * eds_vr (zero at that point) to lj_energy[0][0], so
sum_i p_i dV_i/dl is never booked. Fix: -inf seed, "- max", multi_s loop over all pairs (skipping (0,1), done before the loop),
and eds_vr += pi * eds_vi[state] as single_s does at :444-445.

